A71 diagnostic: log task holds (task_suspend, task_suspend2, pid_suspend and the matching resumes) of the
processes named in sweetdtlog, with the caller and the stop counts, at most 400 lines. Settings hangs when it
is reopened from the background; its os_log stops at didEnterBackground and nothing arrives on the reopen
(2026-11-24), so this shows whether it stays suspended and who suspended it. No new boot-arg.

diff --git a/osfmk/kern/task.c b/osfmk/kern/task.c
